 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5ksM5aeUQjkQ7kNvwFZtF0U&_nc_oc=AdpdnwvLFVpbncu6t6t6NkLeP2KBA0EcmvCtykJASJAgmwoxGYggtUpeZ26pSr7K2p0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5CJkSNBjxOgwOOC4RYkGOIl2QrBCEuAZ5rpwVGAAUXg&oe=6AEC9E41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TmELCXLbKcoQ7kNvwG-CaHJ&_nc_oc=AdofokUAwycxzdce-PB_MVLX2ZdR8tKjmY5ohlwFtFLlAElRZdFOnGLfL1Ao1C_IPkU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQHuMeHB65cF0bS895tPJN3E8R9ZieKXIPW9dwRSYF5Q&oe=6AECABA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z6acd51sj00Q7kNvwGT3Fs-&_nc_oc=Adpo2XaSr3ERUFDIldZiXg7Q42vrdWABpxt6ZiR2PzMRWWFvFD7faaYP7bMBG7eLdTU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSorX1KFrhRG3G8MIwenfyG6-3vUdfu5-0Es2Crznr2zw&oe=6AECB59C"}, {"fil